    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Ceramite Sentinels",
    "summary": "Friendly **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units may re-roll a **[wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)** of 1 for their attacks while in a **terrain area**.\n\nSuch a unit is **entrenched** while all of these are true:\n\n- It is in a terrain area.\n- It has not been set up this turn.\n- None of its models moved over 3\" this turn.\n\n**DARNATH LYSANDER** and **TOR GARADON** units have Defensive Mastery: as each phase starts, the unit becomes **entrenched**, whatever the conditions above say.\n\nYour army may contain **IMPERIAL FISTS** units, though no **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units of any other Chapter.",
